  "muscles": {"lowerBack": 1, "core": 1, "frontThigh": 3, "glutes": 2, "backThigh": 1, "lowerLegs": 2},
  "description": "A squat holding a dumbbell in each hand at your sides: sit your hips back and down, then stand up tall.",
